# payment smoke test

### 1. createCheckoutSession
POST {{host}}/api/v1/payments/checkout/{{dynamic_order_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

> {%
    client.global.set("checkout_url", response.body.data);
    client.log("Stripe checkout URL: " + client.global.get("checkout_url"));
%}

### 2. getPaymentByOrderId (should be PENDING)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/payments/order/{{dynamic_order_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### 3. [MANUAL] Complete Stripe Checkout
# Open checkout_url, pay with test card 4242 4242 4242 4242
# Stripe fires checkout.session.completed -> handlePaymentSuccess()

### 4. Verify payment COMPLETED, order CONFIRMED
GET {{host}}/api/v1/payments/order/{{dynamic_order_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### 5. getPaymentsByUser (current user)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/payments/my-payments
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### 6. getPaymentsByCanteenId (manager)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/payments/canteen/1?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{manager_token}}

### 7. getAllPayments (admin)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/payments/all?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 8. Manager cancels a CONFIRMED order -> triggers refund event
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders/{{dynamic_order_id}}/cancel-by-manager
Authorization: Bearer {{manager_token}}

### 9. Verify payment status is now REFUND_PENDING
GET {{host}}/api/v1/payments/order/{{dynamic_order_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### 10. [MANUAL] Simulate Stripe refund webhook
# stripe trigger charge.refunded
# Then re-run #9 to verify status becomes REFUNDED, and check order status

### 11. Try to cancel an already-CANCELLED order -> should be rejected
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders/{{dynamic_order_id}}/cancel-by-manager
Authorization: Bearer {{manager_token}}

### 12.1 [ADMIN] get payment stats - happy path
GET {{host}}/api/v1/payments/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 12.2 [ADMIN] get payment stats - happy path
GET {{host}}/api/v1/payments/stats?canteenId={{canteen_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 12.3 [MANAGER] get payment stats - sad path
GET {{host}}/api/v1/payments/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{manager_token}}

### 12.4 [MANAGER] get payment stats - happy path
GET {{host}}/api/v1/payments/stats?canteenId={{canteen_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{manager_token}}

### 12.4 [MANAGER] get payment stats - happy path
GET {{host}}/api/v1/payments/stats?canteenId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{manager_token}}